Wine Staging 11.16 server baseline, commit f1936f02ba06b5012f89f75901944e8c2d26951c.

Enabled server patch sets and their dependencies only: server-PeekMessage,
ws2_32-af_unix, server-Stored_ACLs, server-Signal_Thread and
dcomp-DCompositionCreateDevice2. Retains protocol version 962 and the stock
server behavior when rebuilding the DPI and wakeup fixes. Generated request
headers are included so no staging installer is needed during the kit build.

